    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikito a Cedar ŋulu aoyak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka epei, elap ŋolo a ŋiuni, ŋirwa ka elap epei, abu Ekapolon kirwor neni kaŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lokoku a ituŋanan, tolimok Parao erwosit a Ijipit ka ŋituŋa keŋ ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aŋun, ŋakiro ŋuna alimu Ekapolon Akuj ikes nu ebe, ‘Aŋuna abunio ekitoe ŋol tooyaar nooi todol aoyau keŋ lodouwon ka aŋuna abunio ekitoe ŋol kiturokinor aoyau keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu ayoŋ epotok iŋes neni a ekepukan a ŋakwapin, adau ekepukan ŋol akisican iŋes aŋuna ka aronis keŋ. Adau ayoŋ akipotor iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaut ŋigelaanotin ŋulu eponito anakwapin a ŋuna aryenyaanak nooi ayepakin ekitoe ŋol kwap ka akimyekin eperi a nen. Emasakinosi ŋaten keŋ kidiama ŋikamukumukui ka tooma ŋakadipaalae daadaŋ, eperete ŋaten keŋ ebilibila alotooma ŋaŋololin daadaŋ ŋuna ka akwap; apotu ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu ka akwap torotokis alotolim keŋ, kimyekis etolim keŋ a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Aduko ŋikyeny daadaŋ natorom a lokitoe a ŋolo eperi a ŋol, alomasi ŋityaŋ ŋulu ka ariet daadaŋ naten keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Ameun nai tokona tari momit, mam ŋikito ŋulu elomunete aneni eya ŋakipi ŋulu eoyaketa, kori edoli aoyau kec lodouwon, mam ŋikito ŋulu emasete ŋakipi a ŋinapaki ŋulu eoyaketa ikwa ŋol.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alimu Ekapolon Akuj atemar, akoloŋit ŋina ayaunere ekitoe ŋol nakibois a ŋikatwak, abu ayoŋ ogolok akipany alokidiama keŋ, emuleleiya iŋes; abu ayoŋ ogol ŋaŋololin a ŋakipi a ekitoe a ŋol, kiudakinos ŋakipi ŋun iwapei towua. Abu ayoŋ elelebik akiyaloloŋ lotuŋa a Lebanon aŋuna a ekitoe a ŋol ka apotu ŋikito ŋulu ka ariet daadaŋ torinyiyosi aŋuna a ekitoe a ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ etamaranik ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin iirarete epite ŋolo aruunio ekitoe ŋol eritakin kwap, apaki ŋina emasarya ayoŋ iŋes nakibois a ŋikatwak kaapei ka ŋulu amaikina tolomasi nakipany. Apotu nai ŋikito daadaŋ ŋulu aya Eden ka ŋikito ŋulu ebusak ka ŋulu ebusak alo Lebanon ka daadaŋ ŋulu alomunito aneni aya ŋakipi tolakaros aŋuna ka aukor a ekitoe a ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikito ŋul daŋ toloto nakibois a ŋikatwak kaapei ka ekitoe ŋol, torukosi nen ka ŋulu aaryo a ekileŋ ka ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin aŋuna ariito ka iŋes ta ŋulu eboiyete alotolim keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekitoe ali alo Eden epedoryo akisikwaan ka iyoŋ anapolou kon a ŋina ailiilon ikimasakinio tokona iyoŋ kwap kaapei ka ŋikito a Eden, ikiwuakin nakibois a ŋikatwak, iperi iyoŋ aneni eperyoto ŋulu nyileŋeritae, aneni eperyoto ŋulu aaryo a ekileŋ. Erae Parao ka ŋajoresyo keŋ irworo Ekapolon ŋakiro kec a ne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
